Subject: mptest: run config01 with the OpenVMS VFS too

config01.test configures its tasks with different journal modes and
page sizes, and runs only when vfsname() is 'unix'.  Nothing in it is
specific to the unix VFS; let it run with 'vms' as well.

--- a/mptest/config01.test	2026-10-18 19:12:40.319990167 +0100
+++ b/mptest/config01.test	2026-10-18 19:12:40.321775426 +0100
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 /*
 ** Configure five tasks in different ways, then run tests.
 */
---if vfsname() GLOB 'unix'
+--if vfsname() GLOB 'unix' OR vfsname() GLOB 'vms'
 PRAGMA page_size=8192;
 --task 1
   PRAGMA journal_mode=PERSIST;
